# alt_auto_takeoff.expect — ALT_HOLD ARM-triggered auto-takeoff gates
# ALT_HOLD の ARM トリガ自動離陸判定
#
# Chain: mode change accepted while DISARMED on the ground (BEFORE "ARM accepted")
# → ARM in ALT_HOLD: props STOPPED through the spool dwell (duty ≈ 0 in [7.55,7.78])
# → ARM triggers the auto-takeoff (NO throttle) → climb to the 0.5 m TARGET → controller
# CAPTURES the target (Auto-takeoff complete) → holds ~0.5 m (the target
# value, not the climb-overshoot peak). The ToF 0.15 m airborne edge is the ESKF handoff.
# 連鎖: 地上 DISARM 中のモード変更受理（"ARM accepted" 前）→ ALT_HOLD で ARM: スプール
# ドウェル中プロペラ停止（[7.55,7.78] で duty ≈ 0）→ ARM が自動離陸をトリガ（スロットルなし）
# → 0.5 m 目標へ上昇 → 制御器が目標を捕捉（Auto-takeoff complete）→ ~0.5 m 保持（行き過ぎ
# ピークでなく目標値）。ToF 0.15 m 空中エッジは ESKF ハンドオフ。
exit 0
log_contains any "Mode change: STABILIZE → ALT_HOLD"
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Vertical handoff: takeoff"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
order "Mode change: STABILIZE → ALT_HOLD" "ARM accepted"
order "ARM accepted" "Auto-takeoff engaged"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Vertical handoff: takeoff"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
metric duty_max < 0.05 in 7.55 7.78
metric alt_mean > 0.42 in 12.0 16.0
metric alt_mean < 0.62 in 12.0 16.0
metric alt_rmse < 0.08 in 12.0 16.0
# alt_band upper bound 0.55 (basis: 14 real auto-takeoffs in ALT_HOLD/POS_HOLD, window takeoff+4.2..+8.2 s, ESKF altitude:
# alt_band p50 0.164, p90 0.443, max 0.521 -> the real max rounded up). An upper bound near 0.20 is not used: it fits a
# plant whose swing is only 0.008, smaller than every real takeoff.
# 実機14回の離陸（p50 0.164・p90 0.443・最大 0.521）の最大を切り上げて上限 0.55 とする。0.20 付近の上限は採らない:
# 振れ幅が 0.008 しかないプラントに合うだけで、実機の全離陸より小さい。
metric alt_band < 0.55 in 12.0 16.0
# alt_band lower bound 0.05: it sits just below the real minimum 0.062 and catches a plant whose altitude swing is far smaller
# than any real takeoff (a swing of 0.008 trips it; the R_out plant gives about 0.267).
# 下限 0.05 は実機の最小 0.062 のすぐ下に置き、高度の振れ幅が実機より小さくなりすぎるプラント（振れ幅 0.008 など）を
# 検出する（R_out プラントは約 0.267）。
metric alt_band > 0.05 in 12.0 16.0
metric duty_max < 0.92 in 12.0 16.0
metric tilt_max < 0.1745 in 9.0 16.0  # 10.0 deg
